<title>USA: Badger Meter cites lower costs for Q4 net rise.</title>
<headline>Badger Meter cites lower costs for Q4 net rise.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Badger Meter Inc said Thursday lower manufacturing costs, higher sales and a new mix of products helped earnings increase 58.8 percent in the fourth quarter ended December 31.</p>
<p>The company reported net income of $1.4 million, up from $896,000 one year ago. Sales totaled $28.3 million compared to $26.3 million in the fourth quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>Badger Meter makes products used in flow measurement and control technology for industrial and utility markets.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading up 3/4 Thursday at 39-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
